LayoutGrid 29x5

Components:
  [0] input_pin "a" @(0,0) 6x1
  [1] input_pin "b" @(0,4) 6x1
  [18] output_pin "out" @(23,0) 6x1
  [19] subcircuit:xor "g" @(10,0) 9x3

Wires:
  0.out -> 19.in: (5,0) -> (6,0) -> (6,1) -> (10,1)
  1.out -> 19.in: (5,4) -> (7,4) -> (7,1) -> (10,1)
  19.out -> 18.in: (18,1) -> (19,1) -> (19,0) -> (23,0)

Crossings:
  wire 0.out->19.in @(7,1)
  wire 1.out->19.in @(7,1)
